{"id":786,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Although called a guardian deity, Tapu Lele is devoid of guilt about its cruel disposition and can be described as nature incarnate."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It heals the wounds of people and Pokémon by sprinkling them with its sparkling scales. This guardian deity is worshiped on Akala."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"As it flutters about, it scatters its strangely glowing scales. Touching them is said to restore good health on the spot."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"This guardian deity of Akala is guilelessly cruel. The fragrant aroma of flowers is the source of its energy."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Psychic Surge","hidden":false,"description":"Turns the ground into Psychic Terrain when the Pokémon enters a battle."},{"name":"Telepathy","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon anticipates and dodges the attacks of its allies."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Pink","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":786,"name":"Tapu Lele","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,93],[1,310],[5,110],[10,312],[15,577],[20,60],[25,260],[30,597],[35,230],[40,326],[45,473],[50,212],[55,717],[60,585],[65,321],[70,285],[75,678]],"machine":[502,347,204,605,577,203,412,263,374,411,248,416,447,385,63,334,113,478,583,384,182,94,678,427,473,115,156,496,219,247,285,214,173,683,500,164,241,269,168,87,85,472],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv8-92","name":"Tapu Lele","set":"Surging Sparks","date":"2024-11-08","rarity":"Rare","number":"92","artist":null,"img":"sv8/92"},{"id":"swsh12pt5-64","name":"Tapu Lele","set":"Crown Zenith","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"64","artist":"Saya Tsuruta","img":"swsh12pt5/64"},{"id":"cel25c-60_A","name":"Tapu Lele-GX","set":"Celebrations: Classic Collection","date":"2021-10-08","rarity":"Classic Collection","number":"60","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"cel25c/60_A